  "content": "10/28/26\n- start more simple\n- food\n- sleep\n- train(maybe the values -> \"evolve\" into an umamusume?)\n- !!!or maybe you just pick a 'gate' for your starting uma..?!!! and it's random?\n- then you make a 2nd uma -> \"evolves\"\n- then you have the 2 do an 'inspiration' thing like at the start of careers and you get a fresh uma (back to one uma)\n- no, just have one uma at all times\n- maybe you get bonus stats? or items? idk\n- simplify rooms aka no walls(maybe you can switch the bg though)\n\n- also i dont really like how tamagotchis work with you having to watch over the pets all the time, so maybe i just make this a bit more like the game..?\n- but isn't that just copying the game.....?(well, in a much more simplified sense)\n- maybe you also have races and depending on how well you do for the career->you can get alts, items, etc?\n- which uma you get and which alt is also randomized but you just improve your chances? or open yourself to certain pools?\n- i kind of like the idea of it being more princess maker/uma-like and being based on turns rather than in real time\n"
